ght: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYADSyESjJb27bEp42eS9KUkyajrx1nQWcmDJMqiauibtrAewG8UUS119bZuSs24JB41eK4jSPfzbA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 847px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SYADSyESjJb27bEp42eS9KokXH9lr4J8CZg1oXE0u8icuHibECXEubgsu8mseEqSn8rP1DW4bq5icyQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 660px;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于极光庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          极光庄园位于巴拿马西北角的坎德拉地区，与哥斯达黎加边界线只有2公里的距离，庄园现由\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Roberto Brenes拥有管理，旗下\n          </span>\n          有30.5公顷的种植面积，其中14.5公顷用于种植咖啡，其它区域是原始森林的自然保护区；\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJzLHXj1Gx0UMoxJGic9BPqwhQh2ZmFzibQ1icJoTiaxc9vBYLAI2BKDYHxA/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园有两个子农场，其中主力种植生产瑰夏的是Finca La Aurora也就是我们常说的极光，还有一个农场叫做Finca La Alma是用来生产一些其他的常规品种（2018年Roberto在La Alma的山顶上又买了1英亩的地用来种植瑰夏，今年我们也拿到了一个La Alma的瑰夏水洗批次，详情见另外的推文）\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJG9B1S73RiaKSgoicZSLFk6UiajWfiaqUvIUWaEXSZx1wRHQagJ2e7Gjia9w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJcKztnScJD1VYabSLWqPCLZ4jPdCJuXuTjeSWsVibaO7BVbwE5V31sQw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          庄园对外的一个大logo是Auromar，起初我一直很困扰它与Aurora的关系，后来查到了原因，庄园主Roberto将女儿的名字Auroar和祖母的名字Mar结合到一起命名了庄园对外的大名字也是庄园的一个主要咖啡项目 Auromar Panama，除了体现对家人的情感也凸显了庄园对致力于生产高品质的巴拿马代表的瑰夏咖啡的执着。\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R83K9jDql5lpq9lnTRuSIBQl7mzEW4UEBvy5ZedAh5vJaQRicS3d6qPqte3ia9Uaib3TgnAyxVzFzYw/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Robert是一个很有趣，很了不起的人，他是巴拿马股票交易中心的一把手，也曾是巴拿马银行的总裁，由于他很积极公开的对于巴拿马的诺列加政府的批评发言导致了被迫在外“流放”了一些年；他还是一个积极的铁人赛事的参与者，他也将所有的热情现在投入到咖啡事业上。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SJtLL2ZuIyguQ47y6atmxJ5rz8LJcWibicBZwE3u9EfKAAHa7UDmM7S0kafoodJxqsNKUKL6JKhuBQ/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           获奖一览\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          2013年 Best of Panama 瑰夏日晒 #1\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, Blin